.TH kde-bak 1 "December 2025" "kde-bak 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kde-bak \- backup and restore KDE Plasma settings and layouts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kde-bak
.B backup
.RI [ --dest " DIR" ]
.RI [ options ]
.PP
.B kde-bak
.B restore
.BI --archive " FILE.tar.gz"
.RI [ options ]
.PP
.B kde-bak
.B list
.RI [ --dest " DIR" ]
.PP
.B kde-bak
.B verify
.BI --archive " FILE.tar.gz"
.PP
.B kde-bak
.BR -h | --help
.PP
.B kde-bak
.B --version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kde-bak
backs up and restores KDE Plasma configuration, including panel/widget
layouts and common KDE configuration/state files. Backups are stored as a
timestamped directory and a compressed archive.
.SH MODES
.TP
.B backup
Create a new backup and archive.
.TP
.B restore
Restore from a previously created archive.
.TP
.B list
List backup archives in the destination directory.
.TP
.B verify
Verify archive integrity by listing contents.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --dest " DIR"
Backup destination directory. Default:
.IR ~/.local/state/kde-bak/ .
.TP
.BI --archive " FILE"
Archive file to restore/verify.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Show actions without making changes.
.TP
.BR -v ", " --verbose
Print executed commands.
.TP
.BR -q ", " --quiet
Errors only.
.TP
.BI --log " FILE"
Write output to the given log file.
.TP
.B --no-kscreen
Exclude KScreen monitor layout files.
.TP
.B --no-snapshot
Do not create a safety backup before restore.
.TP
.B --no-restart
Do not restart plasmashell after restore.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/plasma-org.kde.plasma.desktop-appletsrc
Primary Plasma layout configuration (panels/widgets/desktops).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/kde-bak/logs/
Default log directory.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
Success.
.TP
2
Usage error.
.TP
3
I/O error.
.TP
4
Missing dependency.
.TP
5
Archive error.
.TP
6
Restore error.
.SH EXAMPLES
Backup:
.PP
.nf
kde-bak backup
.fi
.PP
Backup without monitor layouts:
.PP
.nf
kde-bak backup --no-kscreen
.fi
.PP
Restore:
.PP
.nf
kde-bak restore --archive /mnt/backup/kde/kde-bak-2025-12-20_14-03-11.tar.gz
.fi
.SH AUTHOR
Someone who believes software should document itself.

